@BookStore_Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:7068

### Get all books (with defaults)
GET {{BookStore_Api_HostAddress}}/api/catalog/books
Accept: application/json

### Search by search term
GET {{BookStore_Api_HostAddress}}/api/catalog/books?SearchTerm=martin
Accept: application/json

### Filter by Author
GET {{BookStore_Api_HostAddress}}/api/catalog/books?AuthorIds=1&AuthorIds=2
Accept: application/json

### Filter by tags
GET {{BookStore_Api_HostAddress}}/api/catalog/books?TagIds=Software Development&TagIds=Science Fiction
Accept: application/json

### Sorting (Descending by Price)
GET {{BookStore_Api_HostAddress}}/api/catalog/books?SortBy=Price&IsDescending=true
Accept: application/json

### Sorting (By Title)
GET {{BookStore_Api_HostAddress}}/api/catalog/books?SortBy=Title
Accept: application/json

### Custom Pagination
GET {{BookStore_Api_HostAddress}}/api/catalog/books?PageNumber=2&PageSize=5
Accept: application/json

### Get book by ID
GET {{BookStore_Api_HostAddress}}/api/catalog/books/1
Accept: application/json

### Get book by ID (Not Found)
GET {{BookStore_Api_HostAddress}}/api/catalog/books/999
Accept: application/json

### Get book search filters
GET {{BookStore_Api_HostAddress}}/api/catalog/books/filters
Accept: application/json

### Validation Error: Invalid Pagination
GET {{BookStore_Api_HostAddress}}/api/catalog/books?PageNumber=0&PageSize=5001
Accept: application/json

### Validation Error: Invalid SortBy
GET {{BookStore_Api_HostAddress}}/api/catalog/books?SortBy=InvalidField
Accept: application/json

### Validation Error: Search term too long
GET {{BookStore_Api_HostAddress}}/api/catalog/books?SearchTerm=aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa
Accept: application/json